      "created_at": "2013-01-21T04:15:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1) Cards like Wraith's Combat Stance: \"First time she receives damage from a target, she does 2 damage.\"&nbsp; (Obviously a paraphrase.)&nbsp; If she is attacked by several cards in a turn, does she do 2 to each of them (but never more than once to a single target) or just to the 1st one?</p><p>2) If an effect says that, for instance, \"Heroes cannot play cards,\" the hero cannot play cards in the 1st phase of the turn - but can they draw a card instead? Or is it like that phase doesn't occur?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:14.958Z",
